Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:08:28.14,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 加拿大公开赛（蒙特利尔）1/4 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:08:28.14,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}谢尔顿 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 门西克 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,for Ben Shelton.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,有请谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:01.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, Ben,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么 本
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,you played an amazing match today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天打了一场了不起的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you please give us your thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能不能跟我们说说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,on overall what you thought of your game?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对自己整体状态的看法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:09.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, it was a it was a great night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 对 今晚很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the days like this when everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这种一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.88,EN,,0,0,0,,is is clicking is a little bit easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,都对上了的日子会轻松一些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:21.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, in terms of mentality out on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:21.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 说到场上的心态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that is a lot tougher on the days
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,更难的是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.44,EN,,0,0,0,,where you have things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你碰到一些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that you're struggling with or um,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己很挣扎的事情 或者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.52,EN,,0,0,0,,problems on your side of the net
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己这边出的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,that are difficult to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.52,0:00:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难解决的那种日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that uh, tonight I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今晚我能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:36.08,EN,,0,0,0,,to more dissect more so dissect what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:36.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,更看清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,was happening
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,对面在发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,on the other side of the court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,在球场那一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and and find ways to be effective
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后找到应对的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:44.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and I executed really well tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚执行得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Ben. Um pretty impressive performance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗨 本 相当出色的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.56,EN,,0,0,0,,tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:50.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Um overall this week, is it the match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周下来 这是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that you're most satisfied of?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最满意的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 我觉得是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that um the way that I returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我的接发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.56,EN,,0,0,0,,the uh the focus that I had from start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有从头到尾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to finish, how consistent I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持的专注度 我能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to be getting into his service games um
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,稳定地打进他的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and not getting broken myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己又没被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It was my most complete uh performance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我这周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,so far this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,目前最完整的一次表现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:14.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I'd say it's the the best one this week so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我这周最好的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You said you felt really confident
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说你感觉很自信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and at what point
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是在什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,did did that realization sink
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in into that game?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一场里的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:27.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Was it the first break?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是第一个破发点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Was it uh right before the game started
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是比赛开始之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:31.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in terms of your sensations?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,就有那种感觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,No, I mean I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,不 我是说我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,from uh the first point first or second point
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,从第一分 或者第二分开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,where we had like a 20 ball rally um
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们打了差不多二十拍的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that I was seeing it pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看球看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:45.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but obviously I thought that in that first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但显然我觉得那一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,game he played really well too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,他也打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So I thought it was going to be a war,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我以为会是一场恶战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,a slugfest and um but I I kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,一场硬碰硬 但我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:55.68,EN,,0,0,0,,of knew um going in that I was feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,心里知道自己状态在线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Had a great warm up today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天热身很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:00.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and and and felt u felt like I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:00.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,was seeing the ball pretty big from from uh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:07.16,EN,,0,0,0,,the beginning of my warm-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,热身就看球看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Hey Ben, you haven't lost a single uh set
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,嘿 本 你这周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,so far this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,一盘都没丢过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,is what do you feel is working working
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么在起作用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,for you here in in Canada basically
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,在加拿大这边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,because you won last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你去年也拿了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So is there there's something
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是不是这项赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,about this tournament that works well
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:20.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么特别
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,适合你的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's a combination of the court
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得是球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and the balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,和用球加在一起的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:27.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh it's a slow hard court,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是慢速的硬地球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,but it bounces really high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但弹跳很高
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Makes my serve really effective,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,让我的发球特别有威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but also I feel like gives me time to create
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时也给了我时间去创造机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and and generate um
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,用底线球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,with my ground strokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,制造压力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that, you know, a combination
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这些因素
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,of all those things makes me difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,加在一起让我很难对付
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to play, especially if I'm returning well
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是接发球好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and able to get into, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能够打进
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the other guys service games.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:49.68,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um, I felt a lot of the same things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:49.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在多伦多也有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:51.04,EN,,0,0,0,,in Toronto last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:51.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多同样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that the courts play pretty similar,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那边的场地打感很像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.88,EN,,0,0,0,,which is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:54.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这点很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,And, uh, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's kind of an accumulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这是一种积累
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, Jess Pegula's had a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 佩古拉在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,of success here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿了很多成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,You won last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你去年夺冠了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You're in the semis. Are you guys taking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你又进了半决赛 你们是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,over the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,要包揽整个国家了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Jess Pegula had a lot of success here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.16,0:03:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,佩古拉在这儿拿了很多成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You won last year also.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你去年也夺冠了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Are you guys taking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,over the country like you winning all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,要包揽整个国家了 是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,our tournaments now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,把我们的赛事都拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:16.72,EN,,0,0,0,,What was the first name you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚才说的名字是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Jessica Pegula.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西卡·佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:18.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pegula.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:18.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,哦 佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Uh I wouldn't say that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 不 我完全不会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Um that's a crazy statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个说法太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Um super happy for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别为她开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a good friend and um I think
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that she's one of the most dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得她相当难缠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:35.28,EN,,0,0,0,,hardcore players 100% year in year out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,硬地球员之一 年年都是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,always a contender at the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网的争冠热门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:42.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but yeah, that's a crazy question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:42.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过 这个问题问得太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Um Ben, you were talking earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,本 你之前说过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I can't remember if it was in DC
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记不清是不是在华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.56,EN,,0,0,0,,or not, um just how the early rounds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,反正就是说早轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,have felt a little bit trappy for you this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年对你来说感觉有点凶险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:56.16,EN,,0,0,0,,How how is the feeling different once you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,等你打过几场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:57.36,EN,,0,0,0,,have a couple matches under you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉有什么不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.80,EN,,0,0,0,,like does the second week of a major
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,大满贯第二周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.72,EN,,0,0,0,,or of a thousand like feel different
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者大师赛后半程
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,for you now in your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在在你心里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,or in your body at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者身体上感觉不一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And then I also wanted to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我还想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.16,EN,,0,0,0,,about um Rafael Jodar's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,霍达尔的球风
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I know you haven't played him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你还没跟他打过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if you've watched him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但不知道你有没有看过他打球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and what stands out to you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么地方让你印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh yeah, first of all, I think
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 首先
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:17.44,EN,,0,0,0,,that um I'm definitely a big match player.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己是大场面型选手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I love uh playing big matches, big stadiums,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我喜欢打大赛 大球场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:21.84,EN,,0,0,0,,big crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:21.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,大场面的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I like playing against the best guys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我喜欢对阵世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh to be honest, I like going into a match
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我喜欢以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,as an underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,劣势方的身份进场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Something I enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很享受这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I think that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,该怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:35.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm learning better and better how to deal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:35.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是越来越会应对了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,with these early Browns or, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些早轮的凶险局面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:39.84,EN,,0,0,0,,dealing with a match coming
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:39.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么面对一场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in as, you know, not a favorite,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己不是夺冠热门
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,but uh more or less a top guy with a target
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,却又背着靶子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,on your back, I think is something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,的比赛 我觉得这是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that every player has to learn to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个球员都得学会应对的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:52.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and um coming out against guys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:52.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要面对那些
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,who are swinging big, playing free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,放开手脚 大胆挥拍的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I think that that's something
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that is is a big piece for me and uh I've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:05:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说很重要 而且我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,been super impressed with Rafa the way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,对拉法这种
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that he's come out on tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,打上巡回赛的方式印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I I didn't expect there to be another college
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没想到还会有另一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:10.72,EN,,0,0,0,,guy within three years who was 500
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:10.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,大学出身的球员 三年内从世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world and then top 20 within a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,五百开外 一年内就打进前二十
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's probably going to be top 10
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 他很可能会打进前十
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and outdo me uh or or what I did in 2023.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,超过我二三年的成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that he's got a great game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得他球风很全面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,complete game, um, good athlete,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体素质也好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.20,EN,,0,0,0,,forehand, backhand, return,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,正手 反手 接发球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,up there with the best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是世界一流水平
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I was super entertained
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别喜欢看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.24,EN,,0,0,0,,all three times by him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,他今年这三次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:39.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and Arthur's matchups this year and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟菲斯的对决
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,they're they're hitting the ball incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们的底线击球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,from the baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, so I'm I'm super happy for him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我特别为他开心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and and yeah, excited to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,也很期待看到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, his trajectory
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,他接下来的走势
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:52.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and what he does in the next 18 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有他未来一年半会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ben. Congrats on the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗨 本 祝贺你赢下这场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, if Learner wins tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果勒纳今晚也赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:56.96,EN,,0,0,0,,there might be three Americans
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,半决赛里可能会有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in the in the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,三个美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Is that something that uh you care
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这件事你在意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,about that you you find cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得这很酷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh do you prefer facing a player
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你更愿意面对一个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that you might know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你比较熟悉的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,a little bit more like him or does it change
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是说这对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,at all for you whether you you face
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.76,0:06:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,根本没差 不管是打
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.08,EN,,0,0,0,,a player you know pretty well or one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个很熟的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that you might face for the first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是头一次交手的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:18.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean obviously uh I've played I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,played both of these guys before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟这两个人都交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I've played Learner twice, Merida once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,勒纳打过两次 梅里达打过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm super uh supportive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直都特别支持
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of all the American players at all times
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有的美国球员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:37.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and I've really enjoyed being able
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也真心很享受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to see how many guys
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,能看到这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,that we've had have success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,都打出了成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, it's not just been one or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:44.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是一两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,but we've kind of spread the wealth around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,而是大家都在开花结果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:50.88,EN,,0,0,0,,um between Taylor, Foe, Tommy, Sebi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗里茨 蒂亚福 保罗 科达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.84,EN,,0,0,0,,uh Nakashima, Learner, Nicholson,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,中岛布兰登 勒纳 尼科尔森
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,so many guys who've made deep runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么多人都打出了深轮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:07:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And I think that it's just really cool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:07:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这真的很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to see the direction that that our country
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能看到我们国家的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is going in terms of tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,正朝着这个方向发展
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I think we got a lot of young guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们还有很多年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.84,EN,,0,0,0,,too, with a lot of potential
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,潜力都很大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that people don't really know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是大家还不太了解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:12.56,EN,,0,0,0,,But, um I'll be super excited
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我会特别期待
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to play either one of these guys.
